# The agent's local working files: rules, and the research portal it writes
# reports, proposals and specifications into. Never published — the same
# patterns are in the machine-wide core.excludesFile, so every repository
# (this one included, and the sibling checkouts below) ignores them.
/agent.md
**/agent.md
/puca-portal/
/*_train.log
/*_eval*.log
/*_run.log
/rt_*.json
/run_nixlm_eval_when_ready.sh

