# Gesture controlled automation: a separate project with its own repository,
# unrelated to NIX. NIX only reads the JSON it writes in its output/ folder.
/gesture-controlled-automation/

# Local-only scratch that is not part of the published product
#
# `testing-echo-connect/` is an isolated Echo/Home Assistant probe kept on this
# machine: it is not on the product's request path and not something a reader of
# the repository installs, so it stays here and out of the published tree.
/testing-echo-connect/
# The Luna burn-in harness is tracked; the runs it writes are not. A run's
# report and state are results of one local batch, not part of the source.
/luna_burnin/report*.json
/luna_burnin/state.json
# The knowledge stress harness is tracked; the report it writes next to
# itself is the result of one local batch, not source.
/nix_knowledge/scripts/knowledge_stress_report.json
